Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Evens wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.12,0:00:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Evens wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.32,0:00:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Evens wins!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.22,0:00:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like Lady Luck's\Ntaking a liking to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.86,0:00:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't that sweet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really something else!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.24,0:00:24.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Not everyone can hit a\Nwinning streak that grand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:25.79,Default,,0,0,0,,For you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.34,0:00:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,That's for the sushi,\Nthanks for covering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.12,0:00:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I think you ended me a\Nbit too much there, chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.88,0:00:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll win some more, don't you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.18,0:00:42.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Man,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.09,0:00:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,to think we were just\Nlooking for shelter from the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.42,0:00:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,rain—I got a good feeling\Nif I stick to your side;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.02,0:00:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never go hungry, mister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.52,0:00:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You might be the finest man in water.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.60,0:00:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,water
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh, sake is going to taste\Nextra special tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.82,0:01:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Place your bets.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.94,0:01:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Odds. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You said that was such\Na beam of confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.80,0:01:11.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gave me chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.66,0:01:27.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Last call, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.28,0:01:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Calling it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's odds!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Thought you had that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,No sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.56,0:01:51.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Tatsumaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.98,0:02:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, looks like we caught a rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys are so Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the sky! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.48,0:02:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.39,0:02:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Free punching bags as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.24,0:02:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This place has everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.48,0:02:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back. Take him down!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.90,0:02:44.24,Default,,0,0,0,,One Sword Style.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Great Dragon Shock!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.12,0:03:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, one sec, mister, I'm a firm\Nbeliever in good old balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.22,0:03:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good and evil, black and\Nwhite, odds and evens.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.10,0:03:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You really got them good,\Nso let's call it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.58,0:03:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.40,0:03:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a complaint for the manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And if I'm not mistaken,\Nthat would be you, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.78,0:03:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Just get the hell out of\Nhere and don't come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.14,0:03:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want it, gotta go over the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.50,0:04:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Setting sail and heading for the unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the\Nwinds and waves as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.42,0:04:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta keep it up, never stopping, no?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.72,0:04:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause I'm aiming to get there first, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.12,0:04:25.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all or nothing, no time to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it later, right now I'm living free.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.72,0:04:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,When your foes look like\Nthey will overwhelm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.70,0:04:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It means your heart's saying\Nthis is what you can't do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.56,0:04:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all that to run is not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Once they're close to\Nfeel the satisfaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.98,0:04:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm rude,\Nhere's my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.24,0:04:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,When things are getting\Ntough, just gotta smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.06,0:04:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If you are going on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you're looking for\Na fresh, brand new day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.86,0:05:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Then make sure your only\Nthought you have is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.02,0:05:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.14,0:05:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,As you're on your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Marked maps will be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.62,0:05:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, with every step that you will take.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.20,0:05:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at all you've been through.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.70,0:05:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Look ahead on new horizons in view.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.94,0:05:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Shining brightly, oh, who\Nknows what's waiting for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.04,0:05:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream living, that's the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.42,0:05:26.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Make like a hurricane.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.46,0:05:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, got to make your mark today.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.18,0:05:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,One dream, one wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.46,0:05:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Your dreams don't run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.30,0:05:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Go for the knockout!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.28,0:05:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Over the top!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.02,0:05:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, oh man, I was shaking\Nlike a leaf. What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.98,0:05:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could you shut up for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.96,0:05:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, that's a mighty kind suggestion,\Nmy friend, and very perceptive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.60,0:05:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing as I've been running my mouth so\Nmuch, my throat could do with a bit of rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.46,0:06:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly, I realize I\Nhaven't properly introduced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.48,0:06:06.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The name's Turner Yasuie, but\Neveryone calls me Seek-a-Fit Yasuie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.08,0:06:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:09.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.51,0:06:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Even when you don't speak,\Nyour mug says it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What a hunk, what a stud.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.52,0:06:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, I bet you can't\Nkeep the ladies off you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.06,0:06:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you following me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.98,0:06:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I got this really strong feeling\Nwhile we were at the gambling house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.68,0:06:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,That if I stepped by your side, then the\Nworld would be all sunshine and rainbows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.82,0:06:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have measured this back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.50,0:06:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,But not everyone stands up for those guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.46,0:06:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're underlings of the Kyoshiro family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.44,0:06:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ayaka's a group from the\Ncapital, real dreadful lowlifes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.52,0:06:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.70,0:06:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.22,0:06:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were a woman, your heroics\Nwould have me weak in the knees.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You see something ahead, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I recognize that place. Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.16,0:06:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That'd be the flower capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And that settlement in front of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.56,0:06:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,None other than Okobori, or more officially\NEbisu, which is also my hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your home sounds wealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:02.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ebisu's the god of good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:04.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a reason it has that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.80,0:07:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll just have to wait and see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.80,0:07:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.63,0:07:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take one bowl of Sabo. But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.62,0:07:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy, who is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me, but he sure draws a crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.36,0:07:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrogant little playboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He has no clue whose\Nturf he's muscled it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.42,0:07:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.04,0:07:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll teach him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.22,0:07:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Beat that iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.38,0:07:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold that stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.90,0:08:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine if you can't work,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,but at least have the decency\Nto die and get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.94,0:08:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.02,0:08:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,All five blocks get one millet dumpling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.18,0:08:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is old man yo too frail to\Nearn his own food anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.08,0:08:40.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.14,0:08:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,you've stuck around long
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,enough time to kick the bucket I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,worked so hard all day long huh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.72,0:08:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,you got something to say the next
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.58,0:09:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,time you talk back to a guard\NI'll take one of your limbs off
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.42,0:09:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,next don't fight back you gotta\Nsave your energy you old man, yo,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,or you're going to end up dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.24,0:09:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Four exchange tickets, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's a hard worker.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.14,0:09:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Here I come.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.12,0:09:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, you damn morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.74,0:09:38.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll run you over!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it, Jaggy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.46,0:09:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.10,0:09:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about I run you over, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.34,0:09:47.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.56,0:10:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, hold on. We're full.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.96,0:10:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You've brought us enough for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.86,0:10:16.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Full!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you should bring another ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.50,0:10:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit slacking off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.78,0:10:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how many stones did those two haul?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.62,0:10:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I lost count at 500 or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Then they're handcuffs?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.27,0:10:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea prism stones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's with their power drained!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.78,0:10:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even want to think about what\Nthey can do if they got those figs off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.56,0:10:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I did my work!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Now work over the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.96,0:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh! What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, that's a lot of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen anyone pull that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.96,0:11:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.40,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you dumb face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.56,0:11:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I made one more trip than\Nyou, you know. So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.70,0:11:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I was still faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.08,0:11:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No, you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.10,0:11:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the strongest and the fastest.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.34,0:11:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know how many rocks you hauled?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't even count.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:35.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My ass, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.26,0:11:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.52,0:11:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Weren't they beat up real\Nbad when they came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.74,0:11:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.65,0:11:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,it must have been the\Nfood that healed them
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.38,0:11:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,because it sure as hell\Nwasn't the slave labor,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:49.67,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.12,0:11:52.24,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not how the human body works.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.62,0:11:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to break their\Nspirits when they're like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, say something to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:11:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.26,0:12:01.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.24,0:12:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't chew too fast. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.62,0:12:09.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you there, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.16,0:12:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,My food!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.54,0:12:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.70,0:12:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,My food is all gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.88,0:12:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,They took every last bite!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.98,0:12:48.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody here's sleeping on the job!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.06,0:12:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This will not end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.70,0:12:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop hiding and confess already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.10,0:13:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, someone help!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.92,0:13:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, you were strapped!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta keep crawling!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,General Tobon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.56,0:13:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The perpetrators are\Nbehind bars. Well, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.88,0:13:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And the dumplings?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,They already ate it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,And you two just stood there\Nand watched while they did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.82,0:13:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, they worked super hard\Nand got paid the correct amount of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.90,0:13:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are we going to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.78,0:13:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.69,0:13:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the vice warden here,\Nand I will stand for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't understand it once\Nthe hippo closes its mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.12,0:13:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Dobon, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.24,0:13:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, bring them here!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll suffer for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.60,0:13:59.48,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, sir, here\Nare the culprits. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.22,0:14:02.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach them a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.72,0:14:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.30,0:14:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought I see a prisoner\Nwith a belly full of food.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish that was me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.70,0:14:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, punks, I'm obviously a big eater,\Nbut you only left me three dumplings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.74,0:14:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.24,0:14:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got two mouths to feed. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.54,0:14:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You think this is a joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.14,0:14:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I got to digest here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.58,0:14:39.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that supposed to mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.72,0:15:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You prisoners wiped that\Nstupid grin off your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My precious Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.60,0:15:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.78,0:15:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't push my luck if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you haven't heard, but there's a\Nrule if you mess with the guards here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.46,0:15:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arms will be cut off\Nfor the first offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And for the second, your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.02,0:15:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As for the third, you'll\Nbe sentenced to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.22,0:15:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So watch yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.90,0:15:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Got that, newbies?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.26,0:15:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no room for defiance against me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.16,0:15:42.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,you took our powers away with these cuffs\Nand we still hold that stone for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.22,0:15:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You gonna punish us for\Nworking our asses off?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.98,0:15:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get this through your thick heads, morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.90,0:16:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The reason I'm punishing you\Nis because you ate all my food!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.78,0:16:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.32,0:16:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Jaggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.88,0:16:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Yibbles!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.00,0:16:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for you to play!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.44,0:16:28.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.34,0:16:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a torture shaver inside there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.30,0:16:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait for the screams!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.10,0:16:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.12,0:17:00.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never seen the\Nhippo go down like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.46,0:17:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice Warden, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.16,0:17:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in for it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.10,0:17:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You will get the death penalty for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't us. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.62,0:17:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think that we did\Nsomething wrong, proof it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell those jerks!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.84,0:17:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.56,0:18:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fresh and ready, get your Sabo today!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to miss it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.10,0:18:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sandoros Special, the best Sabo in town!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.96,0:18:35.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Do it to me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.32,0:18:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.38,0:19:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, now that is insanely good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.64,0:19:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Any update on Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.26,0:19:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If he broke out of that labor camp,\Nwe'd probably hear the news, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.18,0:19:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then again, it's pretty far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:17.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I'm sure he'll be freeing\Nplenty of time for the raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you made it out\Nof that mess safe, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Because now I get to enjoy your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you enjoy it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.46,0:19:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Otterbee?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.37,0:19:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it yummy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.42,0:19:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.33,0:19:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's exquisite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.06,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to see exquisite,\Nthen look in the mirror, baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.00,0:19:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,One problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.62,0:19:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The silver's good and all, but it's\Nonly attracting a bunch of girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.50,0:19:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta cook something spicy that\Nsamurai can knock back with sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.42,0:19:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't make that face!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.12,0:20:00.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're trying to recruit allies, dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.02,0:20:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Franky, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.64,0:20:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Here come some guys now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.33,0:20:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.38,0:20:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Coming through, ladies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.74,0:20:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,This won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.88,0:20:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, we've been waiting for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.78,0:20:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cut in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.80,0:20:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.52,0:20:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Kyoshiro family.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.56,0:20:29.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it, you little runt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.62,0:20:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,doing good business huh very\Nimpressive uh-huh sure can't complain
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.56,0:20:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,your fellows are customers right\Nif you want to eat then you gotta
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.20,0:20:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,wait in line no thanks we just\Nhave a quick question who gave you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.54,0:20:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,permission to set up shop here\Nbecause i sure didn't get the memo
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.18,0:20:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,we're the kyoshiro family and this\Nhere is our turf either you pay
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.84,0:21:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,us our or we're gonna shove that\Nsober where the sun don't shine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.62,0:21:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh, I think I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.48,0:21:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.40,0:21:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.08,0:21:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying you know\Nthese guys? Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:18.97,Default,,0,0,0,,The other day, I performed at a banquet\Nhall owned by a man named Kyoshiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.72,0:21:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Shogun Orochi is truly a gutless wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.90,0:21:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Liquor?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.10,0:21:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I require more liquor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.72,0:21:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a samurai, loud\Nand arrogant as they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.02,0:21:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems he's the boss of a Yakuza group.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:43.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen them before, but\Nthese men are likely his underlings.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.10,0:21:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I didn't make myself clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.16,0:21:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta pay up and you gotta do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.58,0:21:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.56,0:21:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you need us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.28,0:21:55.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else is gonna protect you if\Nsomeone attacks your little shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.92,0:21:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all, then I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:22:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pretty freakin strong here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.46,0:22:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for waiting little lady
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.12,0:22:18.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.03,0:22:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,did you think you're\Nsuch a tough guy fight
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.08,0:22:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,me see if you can protect your little shop
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks so yummy! Hey, Brat! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.54,0:22:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,This shop's closing down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.12,0:22:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.10,0:22:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if that guy made\Nher laugh or cry. We're kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.32,0:22:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My sofa!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.26,0:22:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What, jeez?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.56,0:22:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing pisses off Sanji more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.78,0:22:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Go home already.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.42,0:23:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,The shop's closed, you dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.10,0:23:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Buzz off!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.34,0:23:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The pity buddy's fresh out of sober.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you hurry it up, ladies?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.98,0:23:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Because we ain't gone all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.40,0:23:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I, uh, maybe we better move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.24,0:23:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.88,0:23:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You need something?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I need you to finish your food.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.12,0:23:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.24,0:23:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You picking a fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:35.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.84,0:23:39.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Suke! Kaku! Right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.42,0:23:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put him in this place!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.94,0:23:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.48,0:23:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.60,0:23:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.51,0:24:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.32,0:24:16.16,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Die! Me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.08,0:24:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.72,0:24:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is that Zeff guy so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.42,0:24:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but I think I'm in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.44,0:24:56.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let you hog all the fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.04,0:25:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.28,0:25:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave your hands off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.08,0:25:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.28,0:25:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Franosuke Iron!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.54,0:25:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,SUFLEX BABY!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.08,0:25:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's strong too, I guess,\Nbut isn't this really bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.26,0:25:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now open wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.00,0:25:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to eat every part.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.88,0:25:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody's wasted food on my watch. Get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.42,0:25:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,People wait in line for this all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.48,0:25:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.39,0:25:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You want some, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.96,0:25:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren't my words, damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.90,0:26:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, up there you go, big boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.56,0:26:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What a generous tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.10,0:26:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling it would end up like that,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.62,0:26:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,but you think they'll let\Nus get away with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.72,0:26:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you're right, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.22,0:26:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It had a catastrophic effect on business.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.08,0:26:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We had a line all the way down the\Nstreet, and now it's completely empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.34,0:26:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like the perfect\Nscene for a showdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.62,0:26:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm getting nervous.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.48,0:26:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that girl who had her\NSabo thrown on the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.36,0:26:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't figure her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.68,0:26:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She's always laughing or crying or both.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.58,0:26:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.82,0:26:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.32,0:26:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I've seen her\Nsomewhere before, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.84,0:26:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's a haul.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.16,0:26:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Usohachi, you really cleaned up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.50,0:26:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess I sold more than I realized, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.90,0:27:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.82,0:27:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You need something, kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.52,0:27:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So this medicine, it fixes\Nanything, right? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.94,0:27:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It stops bleeding and stops all pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.06,0:27:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my miracle toad oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.24,0:27:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Makes your problems disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.12,0:27:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.12,0:27:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's wonderful!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.82,0:27:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I think I saw her at the shrine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.66,0:27:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that I hate to\Nhave to leave you without
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.94,0:27:38.82,Default,,0,0,0,,your sofa thankfully there\Nwas some left here eat up
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.92,0:27:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.44,0:28:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.24,0:28:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing your smile is making me smile, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.34,0:28:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, fancy that!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.34,0:28:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard about how awesome your Sabo was,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.96,0:28:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,so I knew I had to get\Nsomewhere I'd go crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.72,0:28:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,But then I saw that line,\NWhoa, Bonnie, that was big!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.70,0:28:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was an even bigger line than you had\Nfor your toad oil, and that does miracles!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.08,0:28:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure does.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.74,0:28:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The point of the story is, I was in\Nline so long that I'm late for work!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.54,0:28:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Late for work?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.18,0:28:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You're working a job, kiddo? Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.28,0:28:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I worked extra hard to\Nsave money because I
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.64,0:28:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,wanted to try out the\Nfancy Sabo no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.34,0:28:50.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But then it got knocked over.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.12,0:28:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That was sad!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.12,0:28:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,But it worked out, so I'm happy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.94,0:29:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.66,0:29:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,A lovely ending, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.54,0:29:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.56,0:29:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, I didn't catch your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.92,0:29:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My name's Dock, but say\Nit with an O in front.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.90,0:29:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. So...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.94,0:29:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Otoko? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.28,0:29:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what this says.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.50,0:29:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Otoko means boy, but I'm not a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.04,0:29:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you get the joke?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.86,0:29:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.92,0:29:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.42,0:29:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.70,0:29:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, at least it's\Neasy to remember, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.92,0:29:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I won't be forgetting that!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.72,0:29:47.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a great name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.60,0:29:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.02,0:29:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, that was worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.42,0:29:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch. Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.58,0:29:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You come back again, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.42,0:30:01.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.84,0:30:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm very late for work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.30,0:30:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Like super late.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.18,0:30:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That reminds me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.78,0:30:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be passing through here later today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.84,0:30:13.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the Oran's procession\Nafter all. Oran?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.74,0:30:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Dock, are you a Gomorrah by any chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.66,0:30:18.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am, so I gotta run!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.12,0:30:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,The procession's already starting!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.22,0:30:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, I'll see you! Thanks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.10,0:30:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,The Oran's really pretty,\Nso don't miss out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.66,0:30:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye, Dock!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.98,0:30:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, she's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.68,0:30:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Really makes you smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She is precious, isn't she? And funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.34,0:30:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally get a peek at the famous\Noiron, this is a dream come true!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's an oiron?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.52,0:30:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a comodo?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.50,0:30:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.34,0:30:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a wrinkled-up paper\Nlantern come to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.52,0:30:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're here, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.28,0:31:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who you calling a paper lantern, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.36,0:31:06.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bring a hole in your\Nhide, you little snot!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.94,0:31:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know about our Oden?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.96,0:31:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you live under a rock?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.58,0:31:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.26,0:31:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.06,0:31:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one Oden in all of Wano,\Nand this legend's name is Komurasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.24,0:31:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Longed for by men, a role model for women,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.00,0:31:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sheer sophistication, a beauty that\Ncould upturn the whole country.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.20,0:31:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She is a woman envied by heaven itself,\NBoth pure and noble, that's Komurasaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.38,0:31:41.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.46,0:31:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A woman like that doesn't exist!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.44,0:31:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out for yourself soon enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.80,0:31:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.04,0:31:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The time is at hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.62,0:31:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,The cheers swell to a mighty roar as\Nthe sound of music marks her coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.86,0:32:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ordon's procession is\Non its way to Orochi Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.36,0:32:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,She will be making an appearance\Nat the Shogun's banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.02,0:32:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The girl you spoke to is a Gomorrah, a\Nchild attendant who goes with the Oiran.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.10,0:32:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, so that's what those words mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.14,0:32:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Oroby, I have good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.40,0:32:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight from the flower capital, no less.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.42,0:32:18.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.82,0:32:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.08,0:32:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You've been summoned to the\Ncastle for the banquet today.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.30,0:32:27.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Wasn't that your dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.74,0:32:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,To meet Shogun Orochi in person? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.42,0:32:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.33,0:32:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could pull it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.16,0:32:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get home and get\Nyou ready! Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.86,0:32:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hardly wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.22,0:32:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hat Guy, you're\Nreally something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.44,0:32:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What clan are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.84,0:32:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You really put on one hell of a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.72,0:33:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Every prisoner I've seen today\Nwon't stop talking about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.12,0:33:04.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.44,0:33:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.96,0:33:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're our hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.22,0:33:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the only fun\Nwe've had in forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.64,0:33:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Guy's kind of a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.66,0:33:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.64,0:33:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for saving my\Nuseless hide in your battle yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.04,0:33:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Though it's a dead, I could\Nnever hope to pay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.44,0:33:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to beat him anyway. It's no biggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.14,0:33:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.68,0:33:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take these.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.06,0:33:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't work on an empty stomach, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.42,0:33:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, I couldn't possibly\Naccept such a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.02,0:33:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just a good-for-nothing,\Nundeserving of such kindness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.38,0:33:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, just take it. You're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.20,0:33:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.78,0:33:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to use it wisely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.24,0:33:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you sincerely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.96,0:33:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you sincerely. What a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.92,0:34:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.14,0:34:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Race, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.54,0:34:05.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pardon the wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.36,0:34:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I have located the key to your\Nhandcuffs, but I could not acquire it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.88,0:34:12.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's under tight security.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.72,0:34:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to being carefully guarded,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.84,0:34:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,they have placed it in\Na sea prism stone box.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.42,0:34:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Vexing!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.33,0:34:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But I vow to steal it all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.32,0:34:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.24,0:34:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.52,0:34:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.46,0:34:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.34,0:34:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Couldn't help but notice\Nhow hard you're working.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.26,0:34:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder why.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.66,0:35:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Really want to hold all\Nthose dumplings to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.34,0:35:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you? Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.74,0:35:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not giving you any get\Nyour own caribou That was
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.88,0:35:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,awfully rude after all you\Nand I go way back don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.34,0:35:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wet-haired caribou of the caribou\Npirates this despicable man left
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.82,0:35:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy beneath the Sabaody archipelago\NHe has quite the reputation
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.82,0:35:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He attempted to raid the Sunny when\Nit was descending to Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.88,0:35:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but his plan failed and he was\Ncaptured by the Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.54,0:35:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,When their adventure on Fishman Island was\Ncoming to a close, they found it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.98,0:35:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,trying to kidnap a group of mermaids.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.00,0:35:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to Luffy and Peckums,\Nhis plan was foiled.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.86,0:35:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, after reaching the new world,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.40,0:35:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,he wormed his way out of one\Nfailed scheme after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.08,0:35:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,For a time, it seemed that he\Nhad found a new way of life,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.56,0:35:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,that is, until Drake showed up suddenly!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Promptly defeated him and dragged\Nhim off to the land of Wano.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.42,0:36:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he is forced to work at the excavation\Nlabor camp in Udon alongside Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.38,0:36:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Be a pal,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.34,0:36:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,mister—come on, help the needy!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.10,0:36:13.93,Default,,0,0,0,,needy
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.72,0:36:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you could share one\Nmeasly millet dumpling with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.74,0:36:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Earn it to yourself, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.50,0:36:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.58,0:36:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even an ounce of sympathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.52,0:36:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,We're all cuffed with the C-prism stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.54,0:36:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They're supposed to weaken our power, but\Nnot so much that we're unable to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.74,0:36:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I barely have the\Nstrength to move anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.64,0:36:36.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't give a crap. Try harder.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.14,0:36:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, why you gotta be like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.20,0:36:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell you what.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.64,0:36:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me some dumplings,\Nand I'll hinge for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.34,0:36:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been locked up in this\Nhellhole for a lot longer than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.46,0:36:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want some insider info?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:51.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.28,0:36:54.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So what you say? Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.02,0:36:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Just say the word. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.70,0:37:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.78,0:37:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But I can tell what you're up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.30,0:37:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to break out of\Nhere, isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.04,0:37:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.52,0:37:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.42,0:37:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You better stop slacking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.12,0:37:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.26,0:37:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy was really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.16,0:37:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,He overpowered the three of us with ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.10,0:37:26.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.88,0:37:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you'll recall, I was invited\Nto Shogun Orochi's banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.62,0:37:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Contact Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.70,0:37:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let him take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.80,0:37:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He can send in some assassins.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.80,0:37:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That would cause an uproar.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.50,0:37:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,what it did and your
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.98,0:37:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,point yes sir excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.80,0:37:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,me the oiran is almost here shogun aruchi
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.80,0:37:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,excellent oh Komurasaki
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.94,0:38:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,today will be the day that\Ni finally make you mine
